     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "It was a sunny Sunday morning, and that day was my 9th birthday. “What am I going to get for my birthday? I wish that mummy could come back home,” I thought. My mother left home three days before on a business trip and only my father was at home. The party was fun, and the games I played with my friends were interesting, but I "
