      "t": "text",
      "v": " feeling sad. On such a special day, all I wanted was my mother."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "The day soon passed and my friends left. My father was cleaning the messy room. For a long time, the room was in silence. Finally, my father said, “Shawn! It’s time for your birthday present! You "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "definitely",
      "ref": "v-definitely"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " won’t know what it is!” I didn’t know, that was for sure, and felt pretty curious about it."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "“Knock... Knock...” I heard the sound of the door and went to open it. It was my mother! “Happy birthday, Shawn!” she said and gave me a big hug. I didn’t expect that my mother would come home before the business trip ended. She was my birthday present!"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
